# A drive without a diskette, a fixed disk without a partition, and a
# damaged FAT: errors, never a hang.
program: shell
media: B ejected
media: D blank
keys: dir b:\ndir d:\n
timeout: 60
emulators: bochs mame
---
rx286, test build
rx286 shell: type help for the commands
A:\>dir b:
Not ready reading drive B
A:\>dir d:
No FAT12 volume on drive D
A:\>
